CreateConnection: System.NotSupportedException: GatedDataSource refuses CreateConnection: every connection is leased through the gate, so use OpenConnectionAsync instead.
OpenConnection: System.NotSupportedException: GatedDataSource refuses OpenConnection: every connection is leased through the gate, so use OpenConnectionAsync instead.
